line	
line	<str>Talk to Ali the Camel Man to buy the camels for 500 coins. You will need two free spaces in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to a Menaphite and a bandit to give them each a receipt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Ali the Operator and ask to join his gang (big purple tent, south-west)</str>
